      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-14T18:45:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "TBH i don\u0027t like this kind of change. I would prefer to have a different file for ast2700 for now. I can understand it will cause duplicity of config, but thats a bigger problem to solve for EM configurations in general, so lets not go with these kind of workarounds and follow what other platforms have done in general for now.",
      "parentUuid": "19d34472_5defdcbe",
      "revId": "585d40f9de71d9b786ba537543acfdde4582cfe5",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
