      "message": "\u003e I would prefer to have a different file for ast2700 for now. \n\nBut this is the MB and not the BMC... why should we have two variants of the MB file based on which dc-scm is plugged in?\n\nWe can put json-c style comments in entity-manager files now (I added support for that).  Can we just comment it and move on?",
