      "writtenOn": "2026-09-15T01:49:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you both for the helpful discussion and guidance!\n\nI agree with Patrick\u0027s suggestion — documenting this with a JSON-C comment clearly explains the rationale without needing to duplicate the configuration files across the 1st and 2nd source variants.\n\nI have updated the patch to add the explanatory comment above the USBPort block.",
      "parentUuid": "185ec9a6_8e36cb57",
