      "writtenOn": "2026-09-17T16:51:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am wondering for same reason wouldn\u0027t it be better to move the port information to scm files instead ? Do you see any issue with that ?\n\nPS: If yes, then please test with phosphor-modbus to make sure you don\u0027t regress anything.",
      "parentUuid": "d3491096_4f33cc39",
      "revId": "585d40f9de71d9b786ba537543acfdde4582cfe5",
